[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=7 format=3]

; The shell's dev theme: Godot's default look with legible sizes, even spacing, dark panels
; and a focus ring strong enough to follow with a gamepad. No game art: the shell's real
; look comes from Wrysk's art direction later.

[sub_resource type="StyleBoxFlat" id="panel"]
